---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About me and this site.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Christopher. This is my corner of the web for writing about
      software, systems, and the things I build.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, written
      in Markdown, and deployed on Cloudflare Pages. The source lives on
      GitHub.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
